Each time you cast a non-instant Demented spell, a nether spark begins orbiting around you for 10 turns, to a maximum of 5. Each spark increases your critical strike chance by 2%, and on reaching 5 sparks your next Nether spell will consume all sparks to empower itself:

Netherblast: Becomes a deadly lance of void energy, piercing through enemies and dealing an additional [100%, 133%, 159%, 180%, 200% (TL1-5)] damage over 5 turns.

Rift Cutter: Those in the rift will be pinned for [0, 3, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns, take [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage each turn, and the rift explosion has [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] increased radius.

Spatial Distortion: An Entropic Maw will be summoned at the rift's exit for [4, 5, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] turns, pulling in and taunting nearby targets with it's tendrils.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.  Entropic Maw stats will increase with level and your Magic stat.
